  "question": {
    "text": "A vehicle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is moving along a levelled curved road of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> with angular velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The centripetal force acting on the vehicle is:"
  },
